          %h4#CategoryShapedDiagramInComponents Component definition
          %p We state an explicit component-based definition of diagrams of the shape of categories.
          #Diagram.num_defn
            %h6#definition_2 Definition
            %p
              %strong
                (
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/diagram"} diagram
                in a
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category"} category
            %p
              A
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/diagram"} diagram
